      "summaries": {
        "en": "SmsForwarder is an Android app that monitors SMS, calls, and app notifications, forwarding them to various platforms like DingTalk, Telegram, email, or webhook based on customizable rules. Its key strength lies in flexible rule matching (e.g., keywords, senders) and support for over 20 forwarding channels. You can also remotely control your phone to send SMS, check call logs, or battery status via a companion server. Ideal for automating alerts, managing dual-SIM devices, or integrating phone events into workflows.",
        "zh": "SmsForwarder 是一款 Android 短信转发器，能监控手机短信、来电和 APP 通知，并根据自定义规则（如关键词、号码匹配）转发到钉钉、Telegram、企业微信、邮箱、Bark、Webhook 等 20 多个平台。其核心设计亮点是灵活的规则引擎和丰富的通道适配器，让你轻松实现通知分流与聚合。此外，V3.0 新增的远程控制功能，可通过服务端与客户端远程发短信、查通话记录和电量。适合用于双卡手机通知统一管理、自动化告警、或作为 IoT 设备的事件推送中枢。你可以直接安装 APK 体验，或基于其 Kotlin 源码二次开发。",
        "es": "SmsForwarder is an Android app that monitors SMS, calls, and app notifications, forwarding them to various platforms like DingTalk, Telegram, email, or webhook based on customizable rules. Its key strength lies in flexible rule matching (e.g., keywords, senders) and support for over 20 forwarding channels. You can also remotely control your phone to send SMS, check call logs, or battery status via a companion server. Ideal for automating alerts, managing dual-SIM devices, or integrating phone events into workflows.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "SmsForwarder stands out for android, api, and app in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "SmsForwarder is an Android app that monitors SMS, calls, and app notifications, forwarding them to various platforms like DingTalk, Telegram, email, or webhook based on customizable rules. Its key strength lies in flexible rule matching (e.g., keywords, senders) and support for over 20 forwarding channels. You can also remotely control your phone to send SMS, check call logs, or battery status via a companion server. Ideal for automating alerts, managing dual-SIM devices, or integrating phone events into workflows.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/pppscn/SmsForwarder for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
